# Knowledge transfer 6/7 — the complete engine diff of the session

Issue 6 of 7. **My own work.** Every code change of my conversation chain, as one unified diff over the three files that actually changed. These are the laws told in issues 2/7 and 3/7: the active-cycle identity with payload ints, the UTF-16 unit counting, the collection-view size truth, the ArrayDeque routing, and the seven AOSP measure laws. Lines starting with `a/` are the pre-session state, `b/` is the current tree — every anchor quoted in this series can be found in the `b/` side.

